window.Pattove.documentPages["doc-7198869ae4"]={"html":"<h2 id=\"doc-패토브-전체-구상-이미지-생성-기록\">패토브 전체 구상 이미지 생성 기록</h2>\n<p>내장 <code>image_gen</code>을 사용한다. 기준은 로고 정본과 현재 실행 시안이다. 새 이미지는 설계 시안이며 실제 동작을 검증한 브라우저 캡처와 구분한다.</p>\n<h3 id=\"doc-공통-프롬프트\">공통 프롬프트</h3>\n<p>Use case: ui-mockup. Create ONE highly detailed, polished, straight-on product UI concept image for PATTOVE (패토브), a Korean visual DESIGN PATTERN DICTIONARY. This is an actual app screen, not a marketing poster or a wireframe.\nThe first reference is the exact approved brand identity: preserve the compact cobalt split-P symbol with its small navy diamond, and bold lowercase navy &quot;pattove&quot; wordmark. Never rename or redesign it. The other supplied images are approved app structure/style references. Improve visual refinement and craft while preserving product logic and consistency.\nShared app shell: pure white canvas, compact top navigation with logo at upper left followed by &quot;패턴&quot;, &quot;스타일&quot;, &quot;저장&quot;; search at upper right. Neutral charcoal UI text, quiet gray controls, fine neutral rules, practical generous whitespace, sharp Korean grotesk typography, correct Korean glyphs, carefully aligned baselines. The gallery content is the main visual attraction. Small corners where useful, minimal shadows only for actual floating surfaces. This user strongly dislikes redundant text and default AI designs. NO slogan, NO subtitle, NO marketing hero, NO explanatory banner, NO lorem ipsum, NO faux technical code, NO install/copy commands, NO random badges, NO decorative gradients, NO glassmorphism, NO people or laptops around the screen. Necessary concise functional Korean labels only.\nNeutral white library shell remains constant even when examples use expressive styles.\nApproved example styles: &quot;선화&quot; has warm off-white, crisp black outlines and grids, minimal charming black line illustration, restrained typography, square buttons; &quot;컬러블록&quot; has cobalt #2452EE, acid lime #E4FA75, warm white, oversized bold numeric typography and purposeful flat color fields, strong rectangular controls; &quot;풍경&quot; has muted sky blue #BDCBD2, deep blue-gray #283E4C, sand #F4EEE2, flat horizontal landscape composition with one tiny subject and airy thin numerals, restrained rounded controls. These are different compositional systems, not color-swapped copies. Do not replace the actual pattern library with a timer app: timer/collection apps exist only inside style demonstrations.\nOutput: one premium high-resolution raster screen, wide 4:3 or 3:2 as appropriate. Pixel-crisp, clean, not a photographed monitor, no perspective, no surrounding presentation board or title. Every visible control fits its area. Render all requested Korean strings accurately. Keep text short rather than inventing extra copy.</p>\n<h3 id=\"doc-01-패턴-탐색\">01 패턴 탐색</h3>\n<p>참고: 01-브랜드-정본.png, 02-패턴-탐색.png</p>\n<p>Screen: complete desktop pattern discovery library. Preserve the reference&#39;s useful white navigation and left category rail, but bring all component drawings to premium mature design-system precision. Show sidebar &quot;전체 16&quot;, &quot;이동&quot;, &quot;입력&quot;, &quot;탐색&quot;, &quot;피드백&quot;, &quot;복구&quot;; &quot;전체&quot; selected. Toolbar heading &quot;전체 16&quot; compact, right filters &quot;모든 상태&quot;, &quot;기본&quot;, &quot;비교&quot; and two view icons. Search placeholder &quot;이름이나 상황 검색&quot;. Main area a generous three-column, three-row gallery with substantial live-looking component miniatures on pale neutral stages, each has ONLY a short title beneath: first row &quot;잠깐 알림&quot;, &quot;탭&quot;, &quot;확인창&quot;; second &quot;진행률&quot;, &quot;입력 오류&quot;, &quot;빈 상태&quot;; third &quot;검색·필터&quot;, &quot;아코디언&quot;, &quot;페이지 나누기&quot;. Draw each pattern with real concise UI content, clear fine alignment: saved toast, three-way tab switch, confirmation modal, file upload at 68%, invalid email hello@ with error hint, elegant simple empty-state line illustration and action, command search result list, expanded FAQ, numbered pager. No repeated card descriptions or compare checkboxes in the default state. Preview stages have very lightly varied neutral backgrounds; no blue card grid. Essential component text is readable and carefully spaced. Fill the composition with the actual app, first gallery row starts near the top, no wasted hero area.</p>\n<h3 id=\"doc-02-상황-검색\">02 상황 검색</h3>\n<p>참고: 01-브랜드-정본.png, 02-패턴-탐색.png, 04-패턴-비교.png</p>\n<p>Screen: desktop dictionary SEARCH with two selected patterns ready to compare. Same shell and sidebar as reference. Search input contains exactly &quot;저장 완료&quot;; a clear x and search icon. Compact heading &quot;검색 결과 3&quot;. Three LARGE high-detail preview tiles across one row: &quot;잠깐 알림&quot;, &quot;인라인 안내&quot;, &quot;확인창&quot;. Each shows a different realistic way of communicating the same saved document situation: a transient subtle toast over a small document canvas; an inline notification aligned to a document header; a centered confirmation example. Two tiles, 잠깐 알림 and 인라인 안내, have discreet dark selected checkmarks and thin selected keylines; the third stays unselected. Near the bottom show a precise small anchored comparison tray &quot;2개 선택&quot;, removable chips &quot;잠깐 알림 ×&quot; and &quot;인라인 안내 ×&quot;, and clear dark &quot;비교&quot; button. Leave calm white space below, no recommendation essay, no tutorial, no additional similar result rows. The main purpose is seeing alternatives and selecting them, not a promotional search landing page. Show &quot;비교&quot; toolbar control active. Maintain white + restrained graphite with cobalt only in brand/focus.</p>\n<h3 id=\"doc-03-패턴-상세\">03 패턴 상세</h3>\n<p>참고: 01-브랜드-정본.png, 05-상세-체험과-저장.png, 14-스타일-참고-이미지.png</p>\n<p>Screen: detailed desktop PATTERN DETAIL opened over the dictionary. Very lightly dim the still recognizable app shell and gallery behind it; avoid heavy fog/blur. Large impeccably composed white native-style modal occupies around 80% of image width and 76% of height. Modal header &quot;잠깐 알림&quot; with small technical name &quot;Toast&quot; and one close icon on far right. Main left 60% contains an actual generous interactive demo stage, not an enormous empty rectangle. Small toolbar label &quot;데모&quot; and controls &quot;기본&quot;, &quot;선화&quot;, &quot;컬러블록&quot;, &quot;풍경&quot;; &quot;선화&quot; selected. Demo is a compact precise note card with heading &quot;팀 회의 메모&quot;, one short line &quot;화요일 오후 2시&quot;, and &quot;저장&quot; action. A separate slim transient notification appears at bottom of the demo stage with check and &quot;문서가 저장됐어요.&quot; in the approved line style. Right 40% shows necessary decision facts with only short content: &quot;용도&quot; then &quot;저장·복사처럼 짧은 완료 알림&quot;, &quot;피할 때&quot; then &quot;반드시 확인해야 하는 결제·동의&quot;, a collapsed &quot;설계 메모&quot;, and &quot;관련&quot; links &quot;인라인 안내&quot; and &quot;확인창&quot;. Thin dividers, no badge collection. Fixed modal bottom bar has a small &quot;선화&quot; label, compare checkbox &quot;비교&quot;, and primary &quot;패턴 저장&quot; button. The example&#39;s 저장 and actual 패턴 저장 must be visually separated. Refine all widths and typographic hierarchy, Korean perfectly legible.</p>\n<h3 id=\"doc-04-패턴-비교\">04 패턴 비교</h3>\n<p>참고: 01-브랜드-정본.png, 04-패턴-비교.png</p>\n<p>Screen: high-resolution desktop TWO-PATTERN COMPARISON modal, continuing the same product. The background dictionary is dimmed slightly and readable as context, no huge blur. White modal with header &quot;비교&quot;, close x. Two equal top preview areas side by side, left shows transient saved toast &quot;변경사항 저장됨&quot; within a small document app, right shows inline persistent alert &quot;읽기 전용 문서&quot; with &quot;권한 요청&quot;. Clear titles below previews: &quot;잠깐 알림&quot; and &quot;인라인 안내&quot;. Beneath is an exceptionally precise, sparse two-column comparison with four horizontal rows and small row labels: &quot;용도&quot;: left &quot;가벼운 완료 알림&quot;, right &quot;대응이 필요한 안내&quot;; &quot;확인&quot;: left &quot;필요 없음&quot;, right &quot;읽거나 해결할 때까지&quot;; &quot;위치&quot;: left &quot;화면 가장자리&quot;, right &quot;관련 내용 바로 위&quot;; &quot;피할 때&quot;: left &quot;결제·동의&quot;, right &quot;반복되는 가벼운 알림&quot;. Put left/right text on aligned baselines with delicate horizontal rules. No decorative ratings, no green/red winner badges, no invented quality scores. Bottom has separate understated actions &quot;상세 보기&quot; for each column. Large visual examples and enough readable text, not a dense spreadsheet. Preserve approved brand and navigation around modal.</p>\n<h3 id=\"doc-05-스타일-전체\">05 스타일 전체</h3>\n<p>참고: 01-브랜드-정본.png, 14-스타일-참고-이미지.png</p>\n<p>Screen: full desktop STYLES gallery, refine the approved reference into a very polished detailed concept. Shared white PATTOVE shell; top &quot;스타일&quot; active, no left category sidebar. Compact heading &quot;스타일 3&quot;; upper-right switch &quot;집중&quot;, &quot;입력&quot;, &quot;피드백&quot; with 집중 selected, quiet &quot;기본으로&quot; reset. Three equally substantial large previews across the screen, each showing the SAME useful focus timer and two tasks but in genuinely different compositions. LEFT 선화: precise off-white and black outlined frame, small original charming cat line drawing, thin large 25:00, square full-width outlined 시작, ruled checklist. CENTER 컬러블록: lime top band, cobalt main field, huge bold 25:00, short task label, lime circular 시작 control, flat warm-white lower checklist. RIGHT 풍경: muted pale sky, thin large 25:00, tiny sun and one tiny sailboat among crisp horizontal sea layers, pale sand lower task area, rounded cream 시작 button. All have the same short content &quot;집중&quot;, &quot;브랜드 리뉴얼&quot;, &quot;레퍼런스 정리&quot;, 25/50/90 minute options. Beneath each preview ONLY style name, three tiny palette dots, and &quot;적용&quot; action. At very bottom a CLOSED thin disclosure row &quot;참고 이미지&quot; for each card, no source thumbnails expanded. Refine each preview with editorial-quality proportions, typography and line work. No styles with beige serif or generic sage-green SaaS cards. Keep illustration small and meaningful.</p>\n<h3 id=\"doc-06-스타일의-입력과-피드백\">06 스타일의 입력과 피드백</h3>\n<p>참고: 01-브랜드-정본.png, 14-스타일-참고-이미지.png</p>\n<p>Screen: the STYLES gallery in its &quot;입력&quot; view, matching the same top shell, three columns and concise labels. Show a detailed single-step &quot;새 컬렉션&quot; form in each of three approved style systems, and a small completion notification attached within each preview to demonstrate feedback. Same semantic content: title &quot;새 컬렉션&quot;; field label &quot;이름&quot; with value &quot;여름의 색&quot;; public access radio options &quot;나만 보기&quot; and &quot;링크로 공유&quot;; submit &quot;만들기&quot;; success notification &quot;컬렉션이 만들어졌어요.&quot; Do NOT show fake 01/02 step progress; this is single-step. LEFT 선화: sophisticated crisp black line border on warm-white, a small original restrained line illustration near the title, underline field, black rectangular submit, tiny offset monochrome notification shadow. CENTER 컬러블록: strong flat lime title band with bold title, cobalt form region, white concise labels and underline field, lime rectangular submit with navy text, warm-white feedback surface. RIGHT 풍경: muted sky-blue heading section with short flat sea illustration band, sand form area, precise underline field, dark blue-gray rounded submit, pale restrained floating success message. No gradient, no stock photography. Below each preview only &quot;선화&quot;, &quot;컬러블록&quot;, &quot;풍경&quot; and &quot;적용&quot; actions. This must demonstrate complete component coordination with meaningful hierarchy, not three almost-identical forms recolored. Clean Korean typography, excellent spacing, same overall design language as reference.</p>\n<h3 id=\"doc-07-저장한-패턴\">07 저장한 패턴</h3>\n<p>참고: 01-브랜드-정본.png, 08-저장한-패턴.png, 14-스타일-참고-이미지.png</p>\n<p>Screen: the complete SAVED PATTERNS library filled with six useful saved pattern-and-style combinations, continuing same white PATTOVE shell. Top nav &quot;저장 6&quot; active; shared search remains. No category sidebar, no new collection folders or invented management features. Compact heading &quot;저장 6&quot;. Three-column, two-row grid with beautifully drawn component previews on quiet neutral stages. Each saved tile includes only its pattern title, a smaller style label and a discreet remove x. Six entries: &quot;잠깐 알림 / 선화&quot;, &quot;탭 / 컬러블록&quot;, &quot;확인창 / 풍경&quot;, &quot;입력 오류 / 선화&quot;, &quot;진행률 / 컬러블록&quot;, &quot;빈 상태 / 풍경&quot;. All previews render their selected style faithfully: line toast with crisp black rule, cobalt-and-lime structured tab states, sand/navy confirmation, outlined inline validation with short red necessary error text, solid blue segmented progress bar with lime document icon, a calm compact empty state and one action. Neutral gallery backing must remain constant; never flood the entire library with blue cards. Preserve hierarchy, easy reacquisition, no slogan, no tutorial, no stats bar, no randomly inserted art posters or folder labels. Generous readable thumbnails with the same content scale as the main pattern gallery.</p>\n<h3 id=\"doc-08-모바일-전체-흐름\">08 모바일 전체 흐름</h3>\n<p>참고: 01-브랜드-정본.png, 02-패턴-탐색.png, 05-상세-체험과-저장.png, 14-스타일-참고-이미지.png</p>\n<p>Create one large high-resolution MOBILE FLOW image containing THREE flat, front-on mobile app screens side by side on a plain white background, with narrow equal gutters and no angled phones, device hardware, presentation captions, connecting arrows or surrounding explanation. Each mobile screen roughly 390x844 proportions. Same compact brand mark and lowercase pattove wordmark, and small functional top nav &quot;패턴&quot;, &quot;스타일&quot;, &quot;저장&quot;, search below where appropriate.\nLEFT: mobile pattern gallery. 패턴 active; search &quot;이름이나 상황 검색&quot;, one compact category/filter row. Two columns of six legible miniature patterns occupying the first screen: 잠깐 알림, 탭, 확인창, 진행률, 입력 오류, 빈 상태. Keep short title below each preview; no long descriptions, no sidebars.\nCENTER: mobile pattern detail for &quot;잠깐 알림&quot;, with close x at top. A compact large working demo stage contains a note and 저장 button, a visible slim result toast. Style choices &quot;기본&quot;, &quot;선화&quot;, &quot;컬러블록&quot;, &quot;풍경&quot;; necessary sections &quot;용도&quot; and &quot;피할 때&quot; each with one short sentence, a collapsed 설계 메모, and one related link. Sticky bottom has &quot;비교&quot; and dark &quot;패턴 저장&quot;. Detail must be readable and fit without overlapping controls.\nRIGHT: mobile style gallery, 스타일 active. &quot;집중 / 입력 / 피드백&quot; selector. The top fully visible preview is 선화 with small fine line cat, large 25:00 and clean checklist; name and 적용 beneath. A portion of the next 컬러블록 preview appears at the bottom to communicate vertical scrolling. Correct mobile density, tappable controls, no giant hero area. Render all three screens as one coherent product with exact same logo, typography and visual weight. White framing only.</p>\n","toc":[{"id":"doc-공통-프롬프트","title":"공통 프롬프트","depth":2},{"id":"doc-01-패턴-탐색","title":"01 패턴 탐색","depth":2},{"id":"doc-02-상황-검색","title":"02 상황 검색","depth":2},{"id":"doc-03-패턴-상세","title":"03 패턴 상세","depth":2},{"id":"doc-04-패턴-비교","title":"04 패턴 비교","depth":2},{"id":"doc-05-스타일-전체","title":"05 스타일 전체","depth":2},{"id":"doc-06-스타일의-입력과-피드백","title":"06 스타일의 입력과 피드백","depth":2},{"id":"doc-07-저장한-패턴","title":"07 저장한 패턴","depth":2},{"id":"doc-08-모바일-전체-흐름","title":"08 모바일 전체 흐름","depth":2}]};
